紅；亦指丹藥、赤誠。","long_def":"可具體（丹唇）也可抽象（丹心）。比緋更文言。","usage_context":"「丹青」「丹心」。","register":"literary","category":"主題・顏色","tags":["主題卡","對照學習","顏色","系列:color-red","對照"],"daily_example":"他說得丹心一片，契約卻空白。","literary_example":"丹把忠誠寫成一種紅。","source":{"kind":"zi-geng-theme-series","seriesId":"color-red","seriesTitle":"紅色譜","level":"college-to-pro"}},{"status":"active","term":"殷","zhuyin":"ㄧㄢ","part_of_speech":"形／名","difficulty":3,"short_def":"黑紅、暗紅（血乾後）。","long_def":"最沉的紅。血、鏽、夕陽盡處。與緋對讀：一鮮一枯。","usage_context":"「殷紅」「殷鑑」（另義）。寫血色用殷更準。","register":"literary","category":"主題・顏色","tags":["主題卡","對照學習","顏色","系列:color-red","對照"],"daily_example":"床單上一小塊殷紅，洗不掉。","literary_example":"殷是故事已經發生過的紅。","source":{"kind":"zi-geng-theme-series","seriesId":"color-red","seriesTitle":"紅色譜","level":"college-to-pro"}},{"status":"active","term":"青","zhuyin":"ㄑㄧㄥ","part_of_speech":"形／名","difficulty":3,"short_def":"藍綠之間的古典色；亦指年輕。","long_def":"青衣、青天、青春。語境決定偏藍或偏綠。現代「藍／綠」更精準時，青留給文言氣或雙關。","usage_context":"「青出於藍」另義；寫色時接物。","register":"literary","category":"主題・顏色","tags":["主題卡","對照學習","顏色","系列:color-blue-green","對照"],"daily_example":"窗簾是舊青，燈一開就發灰。","literary_example":"青是還沒被命名死的顏色。","source":{"kind":"zi-geng-theme-series","seriesId":"color-blue-green","seriesTitle":"青／碧／翠／蒼","level":"college-to-pro"}},{"status":"active","term":"碧","zhuyin":"ㄅㄧˋ","part_of_speech":"形／名","difficulty":3,"short_def":"青玉色；澄澈的綠藍。","long_def":"水、空、釉。比青更「透」。碧波、碧空。","usage_context":"「碧綠」偏綠；「碧空」偏藍。","register":"literary","category":"主題・顏色","tags":["主題卡","對照學習","顏色","系列:color-blue-green","對照"],"daily_example":"雨後河面一片碧。","literary_example":"碧把深度變成可飲的光。","source":{"kind":"zi-geng-theme-series","seriesId":"color-blue-green","seriesTitle":"青／碧／翠／蒼","level":"college-to-pro"}},{"status":"active","term":"翠","zhuyin":"ㄘㄨㄟˋ","part_of_speech":"形／名","difficulty":3,"short_def":"翠綠；新而亮的綠。","long_def":"翠羽、翠綠。比蒼新、比碧「活」。寫春、寫珠寶。","usage_context":"「翠綠欲滴」。","register":"literary","category":"主題・顏色","tags":["主題卡","對照學習","顏色","系列:color-blue-green","對照"],"daily_example":"新葉翠得刺眼。","literary_example":"翠是還在呼吸的綠。","source":{"kind":"zi-geng-theme-series","seriesId":"color-blue-green","seriesTitle":"青／碧／翠／蒼","level":"college-to-pro"}},{"status":"active","term":"蒼","zhuyin":"ㄘㄤ","part_of_speech":"形／名","difficulty":3,"short_def":"深青；亦可寫蒼老、蒼白。","long_def":"蒼山、蒼茫、蒼髮。遠、舊、闊。與翠對讀：一遠一近。","usage_context":"注意多義：色／老／白。","register":"literary","category":"主題・顏色","tags":["主題卡","對照學習","顏色","系列:color-blue-green","對照"],"daily_example":"天邊蒼得像要下雨。","literary_example":"蒼把距離染進顏色裡。","source":{"kind":"zi-geng-theme-series","seriesId":"color-blue-green","seriesTitle":"青／碧／翠／蒼","level":"college-to-pro"}},{"status":"active","term":"黛","zhuyin":"ㄉㄞˋ","part_of_speech":"形／名","difficulty":3,"short_def":"青黑色（眉、遠山）。","long_def":"黛眉、黛色遠山。偏女性／古典風景。比墨柔。","usage_context":"「粉黛」。","register":"literary","category":"主題・顏色","tags":["主題卡","對照學習","顏色","系列:color-blue-green","對照"],"daily_example":"她只描一痕黛。","literary_example":"黛是故意留下的陰影。","source":{"kind":"zi-geng-theme-series","seriesId":"color-blue-green","seriesTitle":"青／碧／翠／蒼","level":"college-to-pro"}},{"status":"active","term":"縞","zhuyin":"ㄍㄠˇ","part_of_speech":"形／名","difficulty":3,"short_def":"白色絲織物；素白。","long_def":"縞衣、縞素（喪）。白裡帶布料與禮。比「白」多物性。","usage_context":"「縞素」。","register":"literary","category":"主題・顏色","tags":["主題卡","對照學習","顏色","系列:color-white-black","織品"],"daily_example":"送葬的人都縞素。","literary_example":"縞是白被織進規矩裡。","source":{"kind":"zi-geng-theme-series","seriesId":"color-white-black","seriesTitle":"白與黑的層次","level":"college-to-pro"}},{"status":"active","term":"素","zhuyin":"ㄙㄨˋ","part_of_speech":"形／名","difficulty":3,"short_def":"本色、無華；亦可寫素心。","long_def":"素衣、素顏、素材。可褒（潔）可淡（無飾）。","usage_context":"對照錦／繡。","register":"literary","category":"主題・顏色","tags":["主題卡","對照學習","顏色","系列:color-white-black","對照"],"daily_example":"她素顏赴會，反而更醒目。","literary_example":"素是拒絕表演的底色。","source":{"kind":"zi-geng-theme-series","seriesId":"color-white-black","seriesTitle":"白與黑的層次","level":"college-to-pro"}},{"status":"active","term":"墨","zhuyin":"ㄇㄛˋ","part_of_speech":"形／名","difficulty":3,"short_def":"黑；亦指墨汁、文字。","long_def":"墨色、墨衣。比玄日常，比黑有「寫」的聯想。","usage_context":"「墨黑」「墨跡」。","register":"literary","category":"主題・顏色","tags":["主題卡","對照學習","顏色","系列:color-white-black","對照"],"daily_example":"夜色濃得像未乾的墨。","literary_example":"墨是黑還帶著筆意。","source":{"kind":"zi-geng-theme-series","seriesId":"color-white-black","seriesTitle":"白與黑的層次","level":"college-to-pro"}},{"status":"active","term":"玄","zhuyin":"ㄒㄩㄢˊ","part_of_speech":"形／名","difficulty":3,"short_def":"深黑帶赤；深奧。","long_def":"玄衣、玄色。文言重。亦可寫玄虛。寫色時＝深黑近紫。","usage_context":"「玄青」。","register":"literary","category":"主題・顏色","tags":["主題卡","對照學習","顏色","系列:color-white-black","對照"],"daily_example":"棺木漆成玄色。","literary_example":"玄是黑不肯簡單。","source":{"kind":"zi-geng-theme-series","seriesId":"color-white-black","seriesTitle":"白與黑的層次","level":"college-to-pro"}},{"status":"active","term":"黧","zhuyin":"ㄌㄧˊ","part_of_speech":"形／名","difficulty":3,"short_def":"黑裡帶黃的暗色。","long_def":"面色黧黑。病、勞、風霜。比黝黑更「損」。","usage_context":"「臉色黧黑」。","register":"literary","category":"主題・顏色","tags":["主題卡","對照學習","顏色","系列:color-white-black","面貌"],"daily_example":"風沙裡他黧得像土地。","literary_example":"黧是日子磨出來的黑。","source":{"kind":"zi-geng-theme-series","seriesId":"color-white-black","seriesTitle":"白與黑的層次","level":"college-to-pro"}},{"status":"active","term":"紗","zhuyin":"ㄕㄚ","part_of_speech":"形／名","difficulty":3,"short_def":"輕薄透光的絲織。","long_def":"透、輕、曖昧。夏夜、簾後、若隱若現。對照錦：一透一密。","usage_context":"「窗紗」「紗帷」。","register":"literary","category":"主題・織品","tags":["主題卡","對照學習","織品","系列:textile-silk","對照"],"daily_example":"窗紗一掀，巷燈漏進來。","literary_example":"紗把視線變成猜測。","source":{"kind":"zi-geng-theme-series","seriesId":"textile-silk","seriesTitle":"中國織品：紗／羅／絹／錦／綺","level":"college-to-pro"}},{"status":"active","term":"羅","zhuyin":"ㄌㄨㄛˊ","part_of_speech":"形／名","difficulty":3,"short_def":"疏薄有孔的絲織；文語重。","long_def":"羅袖、羅帷。比紗更古、更「文」。勿與「羅列」語感混淆。","usage_context":"古典敘事優先。","register":"literary","category":"主題・織品","tags":["主題卡","對照學習","織品","系列:textile-silk","對照"],"daily_example":"羅袖掃過桌沿。","literary_example":"羅把時間往文言推半寸。","source":{"kind":"zi-geng-theme-series","seriesId":"textile-silk","seriesTitle":"中國織品：紗／羅／絹／錦／綺","level":"college-to-pro"}},{"status":"active","term":"絹","zhuyin":"ㄐㄩㄢˋ","part_of_speech":"形／名","difficulty":3,"short_def":"薄而密的絲織；亦可寫手絹。","long_def":"比紗密、比錦薄。寫字畫、手帕、貼身物。","usage_context":"「絹本」「手絹」。","register":"literary","category":"主題・織品","tags":["主題卡","對照學習","織品","系列:textile-silk","對照"],"daily_example":"她把淚擦在舊絹上。","literary_example":"絹記得比嘴多。","source":{"kind":"zi-geng-theme-series","seriesId":"textile-silk","seriesTitle":"中國織品：紗／羅／絹／錦／綺","level":"college-to-pro"}},{"status":"active","term":"錦","zhuyin":"ㄐㄧㄣˇ","part_of_speech":"形／名","difficulty":3,"short_def":"有花紋的華麗絲織。","long_def":"密、重、亮。儀式、排場。對照紗：壓迫感的華麗。","usage_context":"「錦衣」「錦緞」。","register":"literary","category":"主題・織品","tags":["主題卡","對照學習","織品","系列:textile-silk","對照"],"daily_example":"滿場錦衣，他穿舊麻。","literary_example":"錦是被看見的義務。","source":{"kind":"zi-geng-theme-series","seriesId":"textile-silk","seriesTitle":"中國織品：紗／羅／絹／錦／綺","level":"college-to-pro"}},{"status":"active","term":"綺","zhuyin":"ㄑㄧˇ","part_of_speech":"形／名","difficulty":3,"short_def":"有花紋的絲織；華麗。","long_def":"綺羅、綺麗。比錦更「文采／美感」詞，可寫風景與文筆。","usage_context":"「綺麗」「綺夢」。","register":"literary","category":"主題・織品","tags":["主題卡","對照學習","織品","系列:textile-silk","對照"],"daily_example":"夢境綺得不真實。","literary_example":"綺是美到幾乎虛假。","source":{"kind":"zi-geng-theme-series","seriesId":"textile-silk","seriesTitle":"中國織品：紗／羅／絹／錦／綺","level":"college-to-pro"}},{"status":"active","term":"綾","zhuyin":"ㄌㄧㄥˊ","part_of_speech":"形／名","difficulty":3,"short_def":"薄而有光的絲織。","long_def":"綾羅綢緞並稱。光澤柔、垂感好。寫裙擺、寫滑。","usage_context":"「綾羅」。","register":"literary","category":"主題・織品","tags":["主題卡","對照學習","織品","系列:textile-silk","對照"],"daily_example":"綾裙貼著小腿。","literary_example":"綾把動作變慢、變亮。","source":{"kind":"zi-geng-theme-series","seriesId":"textile-silk","seriesTitle":"中國織品：紗／羅／絹／錦／綺","level":"college-to-pro"}},{"status":"active","term":"綢","zhuyin":"ㄔㄡˊ","part_of_speech":"形／名","difficulty":3,"short_def":"柔密的絲織。","long_def":"日常華麗。比錦低調、比紗不透。綢繆另義。","usage_context":"「絲綢」「綢衣」。","register":"literary","category":"主題・織品","tags":["主題卡","對照學習","織品","系列:textile-silk","對照"],"daily_example":"綢面反射走廊的燈。","literary_example":"綢是溫暖的光澤。","source":{"kind":"zi-geng-theme-series","seriesId":"textile-silk","seriesTitle":"中國織品：紗／羅／絹／錦／綺","level":"college-to-pro"}},{"status":"active","term":"緞","zhuyin":"ㄉㄨㄢˋ","part_of_speech":"形／名","difficulty":3,"short_def":"表面平滑有光的絲織。","long_def":"緞面反光強。禮服、鞋、禮盒。比綢「硬亮」。","usage_context":"「緞面」「錦緞」。","register":"literary","category":"主題・織品","tags":["主題卡","對照學習","織品","系列:textile-silk","對照"],"daily_example":"緞鞋在石階上太滑。","literary_example":"緞拒絕吸收光線。","source":{"kind":"zi-geng-theme-series","seriesId":"textile-silk","seriesTitle":"中國織品：紗／羅／絹／錦／綺","level":"college-to-pro"}},{"status":"active","term":"縐","zhuyin":"ㄓㄡˋ","part_of_speech":"形／名","difficulty":3,"short_def":"表面起皺的絲織。","long_def":"不平整變成材料屬性。比「皺」更物件。","usage_context":"「縐紗」。","register":"literary","category":"主題・織品","tags":["主題卡","對照學習","織品","系列:textile-texture","質感"],"daily_example":"縐裙怎麼熨都還在。","literary_example":"縐是心事壓不住的紋。","source":{"kind":"zi-geng-theme-series","seriesId":"textile-texture","seriesTitle":"織品質感：縐／紈／緙／麻","level":"college-to-pro"}},{"status":"active","term":"紈","zhuyin":"ㄨㄢˊ","part_of_speech":"形／名","difficulty":3,"short_def":"白色細絹；紈袴指富家子弟。","long_def":"細、白、貴。紈袴＝被布料標出的階級。","usage_context":"「紈袴」。","register":"literary","category":"主題・織品","tags":["主題卡","對照學習","織品","系列:textile-texture","階級"],"daily_example":"一屋子紈袴，沒人懂泥土。","literary_example":"紈是被保護過的白。","source":{"kind":"zi-geng-theme-series","seriesId":"textile-texture","seriesTitle":"織品質感：縐／紈／緙／麻","level":"college-to-pro"}},{"status":"active","term":"緙絲","zhuyin":"ㄎㄜˋ ㄙ","part_of_speech":"形／名","difficulty":3,"short_def":"通經斷緯的絲織工藝。","long_def":"慢、貴、不可量產。宮廷、收藏。","usage_context":"點到即可，勿展覽工藝說明。","register":"literary","category":"主題・織品","tags":["主題卡","對照學習","織品","系列:textile-